    "biography": "<p><strong>Attack:</strong> +4 melee (1d4+1, claw) or +4 melee (1d6+1/19-20, cleaver)</p><p><strong>Full Attack:</strong> +4 melee (1d4+1, 2 claws) or +4 melee (1d6+1/19-20, cleaver) or +4 ranged (2d6, Colt M1911)</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Bluff +10, Climb +3, Disguise +9, Escape Artist +2, Hide +4, Intimidate +17, Knowledge (behavioral science) +12, Knowledge (popular culture) +7, Listen +11, Move Silently +5, Read/ Write English, Search +3, Sense Motive +13, Speak English, Spot +11.</p><p><strong>Feats:</strong> Dodge, Improved Initiative, Point Blank Shot, Personal Firearms Proficiency, Renown, Simple Weapon Proficiency.</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> (Dedicated Hero): Empathy (Charismatic Hero): Fast-talk, dazzle</p>"
